{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"builder-retirement","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Builder retirement"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanChat replaces the standalone Builder product. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"/builder"},{"type":"text","value":" redirects to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"/chat"},{"type":"text","value":", the Builder menu item is removed, and the esbuild experiment is retired. Existing project-specific links redirect to their TanChat equivalents."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Project APIs now live under "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"/api/chat"},{"type":"text","value":". Their callers and tests use those routes. The project interface lives under "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"src/chat/components/projects"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The existing project tables remain because TanChat's saved-project tools still use them, including revisions, events, snapshots, and usage accounting. Dropping those tables would remove a working TanChat capability. No database deletion is included in this change."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Unpublished browser-sandbox integration remains disabled as documented in "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"deferred-browser-sandbox/README.md"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Verification: the latest harness run passed all 226 files and 2,221 tests. The production build completed successfully. Full pre-commit verification is still being resolved before this change can be published."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"builder-retirement","text":"Builder retirement","level":1}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"# Builder retirement\n\nTanChat replaces the standalone Builder product. `/builder` redirects to `/chat`, the Builder menu item is removed, and the esbuild experiment is retired. Existing project-specific links redirect to their TanChat equivalents.\n\nProject APIs now live under `/api/chat`. Their callers and tests use those routes. The project interface lives under `src/chat/components/projects`.\n\nThe existing project tables remain because TanChat's saved-project tools still use them, including revisions, events, snapshots, and usage accounting. Dropping those tables would remove a working TanChat capability. No database deletion is included in this change.\n\nUnpublished browser-sandbox integration remains disabled as documented in `deferred-browser-sandbox/README.md`.\n\nVerification: the latest harness run passed all 226 files and 2,221 tests. The production build completed successfully. Full pre-commit verification is still being resolved before this change can be published.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"# Builder retirement\n\nTanChat replaces the standalone Builder product. `/builder` redirects to `/chat`, the Builder menu item is removed, and the esbuild experiment is retired. Existing project-specific links redirect to their TanChat equivalents.\n\nProject APIs now live under `/api/chat`. Their callers and tests use those routes. The project interface lives under `src/chat/components/projects`.\n\nThe existing project tables remain because TanChat's saved-project tools still use them, including revisions, events, snapshots, and usage accounting. Dropping those tables would remove a working TanChat capability. No database deletion is included in this change.\n\nUnpublished browser-sandbox integration remains disabled as documented in `deferred-browser-sandbox/README.md`.\n\nVerification: the latest harness run passed all 226 files and 2,221 tests. The production build completed successfully. Full pre-commit verification is still being resolved before this change can be published.\n"}
